[Log] Step 1: Normalized persistence layer
- Removed reflection-based DataStore, aligned SQL schema, and updated DatabaseService/date handling.

[Log] Step 2: Hardened authentication flow
- Introduced BCrypt hashing, switched login to shared SQLite-backed store, and wired DI throughout login/registration/App.

[Log] Step 3: Stabilized builds
- Pruned unused packages/targets (Android/sqlcipher/MySQL/Graph) and verified clean dotnet build for ios+maccatalyst.

[Log] Step 4: Completed calendar experience
- Implemented CalendarService & CalendarView, refactored HistoryPage to async month navigation, and enhanced day stats.

[Log] Step 5: Shell/UI cleanup
- Rebuilt AppShell tabs in code, removed legacy files, resolved nullability warnings, and modernized MainPage/ExplorePage helpers.

Summary: All planned steps executed successfully; project now builds without warnings and features a functional calendar/history workflow backed by hashed-auth persistence.

[Log] Step 6: Logged CTA + insights refresh
- Persisted MainPage binge button into SQLite, added global refresh notifications, expanded history/records/statistics UIs, and introduced supportive daily detail views.

[Log] Step 7: Remember-me hardening
- Added hashed session tokens with auto-login restore, removed plaintext password storage, refreshed login UX, and extended database schema for token management.

[Log] Step 8: Regression coverage
- Created xUnit project with in-memory stores, authored AuthService and CalendarService specs, and wired tests into CI-friendly `dotnet test` run.

Summary: Anti-binge loop now captures every press, surfaces insights across tabs, secures sessions with rolling tokens, and ships with automated coverage for core flows.

[Log] Step 9: Gentle logging feedback
- Replaced blocking alerts with inline toast animations on MainPage and wrapped the hero view in a neon gradient for a more uplifting mood.

[Log] Step 10: Explore inspiration revamp
- Seeded a 100+ quote library, added animated quote cards, and layered in daily micro-challenges with tactile tap feedback.

[Log] Step 11: History analytics merge
- Removed standalone statistics/records, embedded expandable trend insights, drew 7-day moving averages via `BingeTrendDrawable`, and refreshed monthly summaries.

[Log] Step 12: Analytics + content tests
- Introduced `BingeAnalytics` service specs, validated quote catalogue completeness, and linked new shared sources into the test harness.

Summary: Experience now blends playful UI, richer self-compassion content, and consolidated history analytics—all backed by fresh unit coverage and updated documentation.
[Log] Step 13: Drafted game-loop SRS
- Added modular documentation under `docs/SRS_Bingie_GameLoop.md` with per-feature specs in `docs/features/` (avatar feedback, story guide, points system, leaderboard, trigger radar, phoenix streak) so any feature can be reviewed or removed independently before implementation.
[Log] Step 14: Avatar feedback implementation
- Added avatar scoring service with history persistence, weekly/monthly energy deltas, and compassionate copy tuned by user thresholds.
- Wrapped MainPage with feature-flagged glow card, supportive toggle, and celebratory animations tied to score deltas.
- Auth shell wiring now injects the feedback service; seeded unit specs validate scoring, state mapping, celebration flags, and hide preference flows.

